{"id":"pozadi","lemma":"позади","pos":"prep","rank":999,"glosses":["behind"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/ca/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%B7%D0%B0%D0%B4%D0%B8.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%B7%D0%B0%D0%B4%D0%B8.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Они позади нас.","en":"They're behind us.","words":[{"g":"they"},null,{"g":"us","l":"мы"}]},{"text":"Я остался позади.","en":"I remained behind.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to remain, to stay","l":"остаться"},null]},{"text":"Я прямо позади тебя.","en":"I'm right behind you.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"straight"},null,{"g":"you","l":"ты"}]},{"text":"Он стоял позади матери.","en":"He stood behind his mother.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to stand","l":"стоять"},null,{"g":"mother","l":"мать"}]},{"text":"Позади нас что-то есть.","en":"There's something behind us.","words":[null,{"g":"us","l":"мы"},{"g":"what / that"},null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"that is"]]}]}